513
00:22:01,167 --> 00:22:04,767
That's exactly
what I don't want...

514
00:22:05,433 --> 00:22:07,033
to just be friends.

515
00:22:07,167 --> 00:22:08,967
Why? Did I say something?

516
00:22:09,100 --> 00:22:10,700
Did I do something?

517
00:22:10,833 --> 00:22:12,400
Actually, yes, Joey.

518
00:22:13,000 --> 00:22:15,600
I don't know when,
I don't know where...

519
00:22:16,600 --> 00:22:18,100
But, Joey, there is.

520
00:22:20,100 --> 00:22:22,700
I'm sure about
how I feel for you.

521
00:22:24,933 --> 00:22:26,700
I love you, Joey.

522
00:22:26,833 --> 00:22:31,067
[DREAMY MUSIC PLAYING]

523
00:22:38,067 --> 00:22:42,167
[UPBEAT MUSIC PLAYING]

524
00:22:43,900 --> 00:22:44,767
What's happening, Dad?

525
00:22:44,900 --> 00:22:46,433
Liza was supposed to surrender.

526
00:22:46,567 --> 00:22:47,767
But, she didn't show up.

527
00:22:47,900 --> 00:22:49,933
Something bad
must have happened to her.

528
00:22:50,100 --> 00:22:51,700
I want to help you
fight Berdugo.

529
00:22:51,833 --> 00:22:53,833
I've been through so much
with this person.

530
00:22:53,967 --> 00:22:55,800
I want to be the one
to catch him myself.

531
00:22:55,933 --> 00:22:57,000
He's doing it for Liza.

532
00:22:57,133 --> 00:22:58,600
Because if you love someone,

533
00:22:58,733 --> 00:23:00,033
you're willing to take a risk.

534
00:23:00,167 --> 00:23:02,267
Do you really have to talk to
